  "post": {
    "caption": "Celine Dion's tiara left a forehead egg. For her wedding in Montreal in 1994, Dion wore a crystal tiara joined to a long veil. She told Vogue she had to be sewn into it. She had rehearsed on a wood floor, but the church aisle was carpeted, which changed how the tiara sat. She wore it through the ceremony and party. When it came off she found a cut, and by morning a lump the size of an egg sat on her forehead. She saw a doctor and took antibiotics for about three weeks. She says she would change nothing. The ceremony was shown live on Canadian television.",
